    {
      "id": "rs-intro",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "boxed",
        "margin": {
          "unit": "px",
          "bottom": "25"
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "rs-intro-text",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"color: #333; margin-bottom: 1.5em; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Why Choose Royal SMTP?</strong> WordPress's default mail function often fails to deliver emails reliably. <strong>Royal SMTP</strong> solves this by connecting your site to trusted SMTP servers like <strong>Gmail, Outlook, Amazon SES, SendGrid, Mailgun</strong>, and more—ensuring your emails always reach the inbox.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rs-features",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "boxed",
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "background_background": "classic",
        "background_color": "#f8f9fa",
        "padding": {
          "unit": "px",
          "top": "25",
          "right": "25",
          "bottom": "25",
          "left": "25"
        },
        "border_radius": {
          "unit": "px",
          "top": "12",
          "right": "12",
          "bottom": "12",
          "left": "12"
        },
        "border_border": "solid",
        "border_width": {
          "unit": "px",
          "top": "0",
          "right": "0",
          "bottom": "0",
          "left": "5"
        },
        "border_color": "#3498db",
        "margin": {
          "unit": "px",
          "bottom": "25"
        }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "rs-features-heading",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "🚀 Powerful Features at Your Fingertips",
            "title_color": "#3498db",
            "typography_typography": "custom",
            "typography_font_size": {
              "unit": "em",
              "size": 1.3
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rs-features-list",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"color: #555; margin-bottom: 15px;\">Royal SMTP comes with everything you need to ensure reliable email delivery:</p><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\"><strong style=\"color: #3498db;\">📮 Multiple SMTP Providers:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Support for Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo, Amazon SES, SendGrid, Mailgun, SMTP.com, Brevo, Postmark, SparkPost, and custom SMTP servers.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #27ae60;\"><strong style=\"color: #27ae60;\">✅ One-Click Test Email:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Instantly verify your SMTP configuration works correctly with our built-in email tester.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #9b59b6;\"><strong style=\"color: #9b59b6;\">🔌 Connection Test:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Test SMTP server connectivity before sending any emails to ensure everything is set up correctly.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;\"><strong style=\"color: #e74c3c;\">📋 Email Logs:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Keep track of every email sent from your site with detailed logging, including recipient, subject, and delivery status.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #f39c12;\"><strong style=\"color: #f39c12;\">🔐 Secure Authentication:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Full support for TLS/SSL encryption, OAuth 2.0 for Gmail/Outlook, and secure credential storage.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #1abc9c;\"><strong style=\"color: #1abc9c;\">🎨 Beautiful Admin Interface:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Modern, intuitive dashboard with SweetAlert2 notifications and responsive design.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #34495e;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e;\">📊 DataTables Integration:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Powerful sorting, filtering, and pagination for email logs with export capabilities.</span></div><div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #e67e22;\"><strong style=\"color: #e67e22;\">🌐 Multilingual Ready:</strong> <span style=\"color: #555;\">Full translation support with Bengali (বাংলা) included out of the box.</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
